  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n3(2)/(3) + 6(7)/(12) + 4(9)/(36) + 5 + 7(1)/(12) + ? = whole number\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\n3(2)/(3) + 6(7)/(12) + 4(9)/(36) + 5 + 7(1)/(12) \n\n⇒ (11)/(3) + ( 79)/(12) + ( 153)/(36) + { 5} + ( 85)/(12)\n\n⇒ (11)/(3) + ( 79)/(12) + ( 85)/(12) + ( 153)/(36) + 5 \n\n⇒ (11)/(3) + ( 41)/(3) + ( 153)/(36) + 5 \n\n⇒ (52)/(3) + frac {153}{36} + 5 \n\n⇒ ((624 + 153 + 180))/(36)\n\n⇒ (957)/(36) = (319)/(12) or 26(7)/(12)\n\nNow to make it a whole no. the next whole no. is 27 then\n\n⇒ 26(7)/(12) + x = 27\n\n⇒ x = 27 - 26(7)/(12) = (5)/(12)\n\n**∴ To make the sum a whole number we have to add (5)/(12).**",
